@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title component overview - project communication

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Unity VR" as Unity
actor "Browser debug" as Browser

component "webrtc_server\nWebRTC gateway" as WebRtcServer
component "moveit_server\nteleop control" as MoveItServer
component "TIAGo robot\nROS 2 graph" as Robot
component "coturn\nTURN relay" as Coturn
database "logs/<timestamp>" as Logs

Unity --> WebRtcServer : HTTP config/signaling\nWebRTC video + input
Browser --> WebRtcServer : HTTP config/state/signaling\nWebRTC video + input
Unity .. Coturn : ICE relay
Browser .. Coturn : ICE relay

WebRtcServer --> MoveItServer : /vive/* ROS 2 topics
Robot --> WebRtcServer : camera, joint states, TF
Robot --> MoveItServer : joint states, TF, robot model
MoveItServer --> Robot : head, arm, gripper trajectories
MoveItServer --> Robot : guarded base Twist on /key_vel

WebRtcServer --> Logs : webrtc_server_wifi.log
MoveItServer --> Logs : moveit_server_wifi.log
Coturn --> Logs : coturn_wifi.log
Unity --> Logs : unity-player.log

note bottom of WebRtcServer
  JSON data-channel payloads become typed ROS 2 topics here.
end note

note bottom of MoveItServer
  Deadman, timeouts, workspace limits, prioritized bounded 7-DOF IK,
  camera-clear null-space posture, base guard, Servo, and controller output live here.
end note

@enduml
